(3364068, 468173, 66241, '<td valign="top">Great idea... nice shot!  I bet you''ll win.</td>', 'Great idea... nice shot!  I bet you''ll win.', '2007-02-14 05:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364073, 465550, 66201, '<td valign="top">Great: a photo on topic! Lovely lighting and great clarity on the focal subject.</td>', 'Great: a photo on topic! Lovely lighting and great clarity on the focal subject.', '2007-02-14 05:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364077, 467225, 66201, '<td valign="top">Is focus a bit off? Dunno - am going to come back to this one later and have another look. I really like it in terms of style and composition though.</td>', 'Is focus a bit off? Dunno - am going to come back to this one later and have another look. I really like it in terms of style and composition though.', '2007-02-14 06:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364219, 468692, 61060, '<td valign="top">I like the soft look of this. It makes it aged, similar to traditional music.</td>', 'I like the soft look of this. It makes it aged, similar to traditional music.', '2007-02-14 07:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364223, 468606, 61060, '<td valign="top">It does not show me anything musical besides the head phones.</td>', 'It does not show me anything musical besides the head phones.', '2007-02-14 07:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364225, 468329, 61060, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the trumpet looks fake.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the trumpet looks fake.', '2007-02-14 07:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364226, 468451, 61060, '<td valign="top">Really like it. Clean Lines.</td>', 'Really like it. Clean Lines.', '2007-02-14 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364227, 466586, 61060, '<td valign="top">Not what I thought of for school age music.</td>', 'Not what I thought of for school age music.', '2007-02-14 07:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364236, 465849, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, lighitng, and conversion to B/W.  I love how the imaged is cropped to have only the flute completely in view.</td>', 'Very nice composition, lighitng, and conversion to B/W.  I love how the imaged is cropped to have only the flute completely in view.', '2007-02-14 07:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364242, 468384, 67152, '<td valign="top">What great instruments!  This image could be improved with some of the following - improved lighting -  there are too many shadows that distract - fix the focus - it seems much of the image in the foreground is OOF.</td>', 'What great instruments!  This image could be improved with some of the following - improved lighting -  there are too many shadows that distract - fix the focus - it seems much of the image in the foreground is OOF.', '2007-02-14 07:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364253, 468397, 67152, '<td valign="top">It is a wonderful sentiment in your title.  Love the idea of the closeup on the flute and the metaphor of the flower.  The lighting needs some help - the flower probably could use a little more emphasis and the shadow takes up a great deal of the image and does not add a lot</td>', 'It is a wonderful sentiment in your title.  Love the idea of the closeup on the flute and the metaphor of the flower.  The lighting needs some help - the flower probably could use a little more emphasis and the shadow takes up a great deal of the image and does not add a lot', '2007-02-14 07:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364255, 467150, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the hands and OOF on the bell and player.  Very well done image.</td>', 'Nice focus on the hands and OOF on the bell and player.  Very well done image.', '2007-02-14 07:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364260, 468686, 67152, '<td valign="top">Bright area in the lower right really takes away from a nice image.  I think it is the chin guard -  Too bad you could not remove it before you got this image - the perspective and B/W conversion is pretty nice.</td>', 'Bright area in the lower right really takes away from a nice image.  I think it is the chin guard -  Too bad you could not remove it before you got this image - the perspective and B/W conversion is pretty nice.', '2007-02-14 07:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364264, 467707, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like how the focus is tight and the strings seem to be moving from the OOF areas.</td>', 'I like how the focus is tight and the strings seem to be moving from the OOF areas.', '2007-02-14 07:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364266, 467563, 24744, '<td valign="top">This image would have worked better in colour, with stronger side-lighting, imho.<br/> <br/>Coming back to bump up - despite the colour, i rather like the strong diagonal composition and the slight blur of the pencil.</td>', 'This image would have worked better in colour, with stronger side-lighting, imho. Coming back to bump up - despite the colour, i rather like the strong diagonal composition and the slight blur of the pencil.', '2007-02-14 07:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364267, 467949, 67152, '<td valign="top">The boy has a great expression and the composition is pretty good.  I worry that the significant noise in the image will take the score down.</td>', 'The boy has a great expression and the composition is pretty good.  I worry that the significant noise in the image will take the score down.', '2007-02-14 07:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364273, 467859, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting and composition, but I can see the photographer in the drum</td>', 'Very good lighting and composition, but I can see the photographer in the drum', '2007-02-14 07:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364362, 468384, 73863, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2007-02-14 07:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364365, 468549, 73863, '<td valign="top">too much confusion</td>', 'too much confusion', '2007-02-14 07:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364368, 468605, 73863, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2007-02-14 07:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364399, 468206, 2553, '<td valign="top">I totally love the concept here, but it would have had so much more impact if the background had been blurred out.  The wrinkles in the backdrop are really distracting to me.</td>', 'I totally love the concept here, but it would have had so much more impact if the background had been blurred out.  The wrinkles in the backdrop are really distracting to me.', '2007-02-14 08:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364441, 467607, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white treatment on this, and the whole rock star up against the rocks thing.  Kinda cool. The actual tonal range of the blacks and whites is good, but there is just too much gray for me - she almost blends into the rocks.  I would also like to have seen this cropped in on the left just a bit so that she isn''t so centered in the frame.</td>', 'Love the black and white treatment on this, and the whole rock star up against the rocks thing.  Kinda cool. The actual tonal range of the blacks and whites is good, but there is just too much gray for me - she almost blends into the rocks.  I would also like to have seen this cropped in on the left just a bit so that she isn''t so centered in the frame.', '2007-02-14 08:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364450, 466325, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m just not seeing music on this. Not in the spirit of the challenge IMO.</td>', 'I''m just not seeing music on this. Not in the spirit of the challenge IMO.', '2007-02-14 08:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364490, 467707, 51538, '<td valign="top">A pretty good year...</td>', 'A pretty good year...', '2007-02-14 08:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
