(3365671, 468303, 58610, '<td valign="top">Great pov and comp. Wish you''d given him more room at the bottom. Lighting is nicely done albeit a little dark (could be my monitor).</td>', 'Great pov and comp. Wish you''d given him more room at the bottom. Lighting is nicely done albeit a little dark (could be my monitor).', '2007-02-14 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
