(3366262, 465988, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice image of actual students practicing.  The perspective is nice, where we can see the faces of all the students in the string group.  The only thing I don''t like it the boy from the other student off camera.  This blocks our view of the second cellist.  There are some minor blown out areas on the music but it is not much to complain about.  Overall, a good image. 6</td>', 'Very nice image of actual students practicing.  The perspective is nice, where we can see the faces of all the students in the string group.  The only thing I don''t like it the boy from the other student off camera.  This blocks our view of the second cellist.  There are some minor blown out areas on the music but it is not much to complain about.  Overall, a good image. 6', '2007-02-14 15:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366267, 467857, 66201, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this one, the style, grunge look and so on. Technically my one twinge is that it seems to have been over-sharpened of something...the fur on the jacket is doing something weird..maybe it''s just my monitor?</td>', 'I love the composition of this one, the style, grunge look and so on. Technically my one twinge is that it seems to have been over-sharpened of something...the fur on the jacket is doing something weird..maybe it''s just my monitor?', '2007-02-14 15:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
