(3366302, 468689, 67152, '<td valign="top">This image realyly has a lot going on for it - attractive kids, nice motion, good lighting.  However, the head of the pianist in the foreground takes away and makes this seem more of a snapshot.  Cropping this to only have the kids in view may help this.</td>', 'This image realyly has a lot going on for it - attractive kids, nice motion, good lighting.  However, the head of the pianist in the foreground takes away and makes this seem more of a snapshot.  Cropping this to only have the kids in view may help this.', '2007-02-14 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
