(3366698, 468630, 67152, '<td valign="top">The dark tones of this make the image very subtle.  I don''t like how the pillow behind the violin is cutting across the image in two places.  In addition, a little better lighting on the violin would likely bring out the warmth of the varnish on the wood.</td>', 'The dark tones of this make the image very subtle.  I don''t like how the pillow behind the violin is cutting across the image in two places.  In addition, a little better lighting on the violin would likely bring out the warmth of the varnish on the wood.', '2007-02-14 17:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366702, 466690, 67152, '<td valign="top">What a virtuoso!  And at such a young age.  This has some nice conversion to BW.  I just would have liked to have a little better lighting on the child''s face.  6</td>', 'What a virtuoso!  And at such a young age.  This has some nice conversion to BW.  I just would have liked to have a little better lighting on the child''s face.  6', '2007-02-14 17:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366705, 468297, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the super close up on the music - but there is a lot of color noise in the out of focus portion of the image. 4</td>', 'I like the idea of the super close up on the music - but there is a lot of color noise in the out of focus portion of the image. 4', '2007-02-14 17:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366720, 468488, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the connection of the title to the horn.  I am not a fan of the cropping - I would have liked more of the horn and less of the floor/table.  In addition, I am not a fan of the saturation of the image - the color seems very forced - especially on the bell of the trumpet.</td>', 'I like the connection of the title to the horn.  I am not a fan of the cropping - I would have liked more of the horn and less of the floor/table.  In addition, I am not a fan of the saturation of the image - the color seems very forced - especially on the bell of the trumpet.', '2007-02-14 17:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366729, 468451, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup on the guitar - technically it is a very solid image.  But the image seems to lack the story of some of the other images that I rated higher.  5</td>', 'Nice closeup on the guitar - technically it is a very solid image.  But the image seems to lack the story of some of the other images that I rated higher.  5', '2007-02-14 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366743, 466722, 67152, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is a solid image - good lighting and color, nice shapes.</td>', 'Technically, this is a solid image - good lighting and color, nice shapes.', '2007-02-14 17:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366747, 468580, 67152, '<td valign="top">I ''get'' the image - you have made a sailboat with the violin. but it really does not grab me.  5</td>', 'I ''get'' the image - you have made a sailboat with the violin. but it really does not grab me.  5', '2007-02-14 17:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366752, 468599, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of going for this type of perspective on this Fender, but I almost feel that the body of the guitar is cropped a little too close.</td>', 'I like the idea of going for this type of perspective on this Fender, but I almost feel that the body of the guitar is cropped a little too close.', '2007-02-14 17:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366760, 468606, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice take on this challenge - it definately is the new way that student''s get their music.</td>', 'Nice take on this challenge - it definately is the new way that student''s get their music.', '2007-02-14 17:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366779, 468365, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the set up of the guitar and piano.  I think you will find that many will probably vote this down due to it being a fairly dark image.   I had to really fight to see the detail in it.</td>', 'I like the set up of the guitar and piano.  I think you will find that many will probably vote this down due to it being a fairly dark image.   I had to really fight to see the detail in it.', '2007-02-14 17:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366786, 467912, 67152, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of slow shutter speed.  I little better illumination on the moving pendulum would make this come off a little better.</td>', 'Interesting use of slow shutter speed.  I little better illumination on the moving pendulum would make this come off a little better.', '2007-02-14 17:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366789, 468618, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice B/W image - it definately is the way school age kids these days here their music - a long cry from boom boxes and LPs.</td>', 'Very nice B/W image - it definately is the way school age kids these days here their music - a long cry from boom boxes and LPs.', '2007-02-14 17:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366822, 468632, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the focus of the student on the music.  I think this could benefit from a little better lighting and some noise reduction.</td>', 'I like the focus of the student on the music.  I think this could benefit from a little better lighting and some noise reduction.', '2007-02-14 17:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366829, 468548, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very surreal image - I assume that the music was on a window or other clear surface.</td>', 'Very surreal image - I assume that the music was on a window or other clear surface.', '2007-02-14 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366843, 468320, 67152, '<td valign="top">An interesting tangential image - I think this would have come off better if the keys of the piano were a little better in focus.</td>', 'An interesting tangential image - I think this would have come off better if the keys of the piano were a little better in focus.', '2007-02-14 17:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366916, 468568, 73235, '<td valign="top">meets challenge, for an arranged pictures: guitar is not plugged in, and light is very harsh(on camera flash)</td>', 'meets challenge, for an arranged pictures: guitar is not plugged in, and light is very harsh(on camera flash)', '2007-02-14 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366917, 468649, 67152, '<td valign="top">Technically - the image is a little dark and the focus could be a little sharper and the cropping is a little too tight and makes for a small image on my screen.  Beyond that, I don''t see the story for connecting this to "School Day".  4</td>', 'Technically - the image is a little dark and the focus could be a little sharper and the cropping is a little too tight and makes for a small image on my screen.  Beyond that, I don''t see the story for connecting this to "School Day".  4', '2007-02-14 18:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366921, 465849, 73235, '<td valign="top">very nice tones, great acpture of the moment of concentration</td>', 'very nice tones, great acpture of the moment of concentration', '2007-02-14 18:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366925, 466687, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the look on the girl''s face a whole bunch - but the cropping with the whole blank white board is unfortunate.  Recropping in a square so that the girl in Blue is on the leftmost edge of the image would get rid of a bunch of ''wasted pixels''.</td>', 'I like the look on the girl''s face a whole bunch - but the cropping with the whole blank white board is unfortunate.  Recropping in a square so that the girl in Blue is on the leftmost edge of the image would get rid of a bunch of ''wasted pixels''.', '2007-02-14 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366927, 465178, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice set up for this image - just wish there was better lighting on this ol'' classical guitar.</td>', 'Nice set up for this image - just wish there was better lighting on this ol'' classical guitar.', '2007-02-14 18:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366940, 468646, 67152, '<td valign="top">Technically - the lighting could use some work - more light on the keys would probably help. Also, the cropping seems a little off -  there is a big black area to the right of the music that makes this seem offset.  It is not a bad image, but could use a little more punch.  To really add to this, getting someone in the image to actually practice or pretend to play would add a story to the image.</td>', 'Technically - the lighting could use some work - more light on the keys would probably help. Also, the cropping seems a little off -  there is a big black area to the right of the music that makes this seem offset.  It is not a bad image, but could use a little more punch.  To really add to this, getting someone in the image to actually practice or pretend to play would add a story to the image.', '2007-02-14 18:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366946, 467965, 67152, '<td valign="top">A pretty nice abstract closeup.  The lighting is fine, but the black line behind the instrument is a distraction.</td>', 'A pretty nice abstract closeup.  The lighting is fine, but the black line behind the instrument is a distraction.', '2007-02-14 18:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366986, 467935, 67152, '<td valign="top">Technically - this is a very nice image - clear, well lit, sharp, good contrast.  From a story perspective (and I think that is really needed for this challenge), it seems rather antiseptic.</td>', 'Technically - this is a very nice image - clear, well lit, sharp, good contrast.  From a story perspective (and I think that is really needed for this challenge), it seems rather antiseptic.', '2007-02-14 18:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3366993, 465847, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice concert photo of a ''hot'' band.  Clearly this is what many do during their ''school days''.</td>', 'Nice concert photo of a ''hot'' band.  Clearly this is what many do during their ''school days''.', '2007-02-14 18:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367025, 465852, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and delivered shot.  Beautiful people, great story and nice use of processing to give a feel.  BUT, for me personally, this feels more like professional music rather than students and school days.</td>', 'Very well composed and delivered shot.  Beautiful people, great story and nice use of processing to give a feel.  BUT, for me personally, this feels more like professional music rather than students and school days.', '2007-02-14 18:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367029, 468639, 67152, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is very strange - most of the image is in shadows and only a few inches of the keyboard are bright.  I think fixing the lighting on this image would help a great deal.</td>', 'The lighting on this is very strange - most of the image is in shadows and only a few inches of the keyboard are bright.  I think fixing the lighting on this image would help a great deal.', '2007-02-14 18:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367032, 468480, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective on this rather strange colored violin.</td>', 'Nice perspective on this rather strange colored violin.', '2007-02-14 18:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367046, 468405, 67152, '<td valign="top">Simple concept, pretty well executed.  Cropping it so that more of the flute and less of the table was in view may help.</td>', 'Simple concept, pretty well executed.  Cropping it so that more of the flute and less of the table was in view may help.', '2007-02-14 18:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367053, 468334, 67152, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the sax is good, but the choice of a small marching band piece of music really does not help - it probably would have done better without any music.</td>', 'The lighting on the sax is good, but the choice of a small marching band piece of music really does not help - it probably would have done better without any music.', '2007-02-14 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367060, 466347, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract - with nice choice of duotone.  But I don''t really like the noise in the background.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract - with nice choice of duotone.  But I don''t really like the noise in the background.', '2007-02-14 18:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367118, 467658, 67152, '<td valign="top">The set up of the image is okay, but it does not jump out at me.  It would probably do much better in B/W.  In addition, the cropping of the upper part of the piano seems forced (I don''t like really elongated images except for panoramas).</td>', 'The set up of the image is okay, but it does not jump out at me.  It would probably do much better in B/W.  In addition, the cropping of the upper part of the piano seems forced (I don''t like really elongated images except for panoramas).', '2007-02-14 18:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367126, 465847, 72467, '<td valign="top">love love love love x419058258973 the band.<br/>but a) its kinda blurry<br/>&amp; b) it''s kind of just a snap shot of a band you saw in concert. No interesting angles, just the band &amp; the crowd... something anyone can take.<br/>so 4. sorry.</td>', 'love love love love x419058258973 the band.but a) its kinda blurry& b) it''s kind of just a snap shot of a band you saw in concert. No interesting angles, just the band & the crowd... something anyone can take.so 4. sorry.', '2007-02-14 18:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367128, 468042, 67152, '<td valign="top">The  flute in the image is just not bright enough to compensate for all the dark negative space above it.  It''s a neat idea, but better lighting is probably needed to make this work really well.</td>', 'The  flute in the image is just not bright enough to compensate for all the dark negative space above it.  It''s a neat idea, but better lighting is probably needed to make this work really well.', '2007-02-14 18:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367143, 468046, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow DOF on the flute.  The color and lighting are very nice.</td>', 'Nice shallow DOF on the flute.  The color and lighting are very nice.', '2007-02-14 18:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367149, 465515, 67152, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this is pretty interesting, but the use of shallow DOF doesn''t work for me on this image - not enough seems in focus.  In addition, there is a strange bright spot in the background that has a series of rings that is a little distracting.</td>', 'The perspective on this is pretty interesting, but the use of shallow DOF doesn''t work for me on this image - not enough seems in focus.  In addition, there is a strange bright spot in the background that has a series of rings that is a little distracting.', '2007-02-14 18:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367151, 465312, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like this approach for this challenge - using old sheet music to tell a story.</td>', 'I like this approach for this challenge - using old sheet music to tell a story.', '2007-02-14 18:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367172, 465849, 62727, '<td valign="top">Very lovely image!</td>', 'Very lovely image!', '2007-02-14 19:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367234, 468365, 68109, '<td valign="top">I think if you cropped a little more off the right had side that would help.  Also the bright reflection from the head of the guitar is distracting.</td>', 'I think if you cropped a little more off the right had side that would help.  Also the bright reflection from the head of the guitar is distracting.', '2007-02-14 19:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367240, 466709, 67152, '<td valign="top">A nice image - maybe could use a littel more sharpness to bring out the great detail on the strings and pickups, etc.</td>', 'A nice image - maybe could use a littel more sharpness to bring out the great detail on the strings and pickups, etc.', '2007-02-14 19:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367243, 466835, 67152, '<td valign="top">Oh no!  The fork!  Nice B/W - I remember having to fix my tapes too...</td>', 'Oh no!  The fork!  Nice B/W - I remember having to fix my tapes too...', '2007-02-14 19:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367246, 465608, 67152, '<td valign="top">Lighting is nice and soft on this image.</td>', 'Lighting is nice and soft on this image.', '2007-02-14 19:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367248, 468567, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the use of shadows - well done to fill the frame with them.  6</td>', 'I like the use of shadows - well done to fill the frame with them.  6', '2007-02-14 19:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367253, 468576, 68109, '<td valign="top">I like the image but I would have liked it more at 640px width.  Also if the sky was more dramatic it would have helped a lot too.  Maybe a polorizer next time.  Otherwise good job.</td>', 'I like the image but I would have liked it more at 640px width.  Also if the sky was more dramatic it would have helped a lot too.  Maybe a polorizer next time.  Otherwise good job.', '2007-02-14 19:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367257, 468689, 68109, '<td valign="top">I like the expressions on the faces but the slower shutter and that one blurry face is distracting.</td>', 'I like the expressions on the faces but the slower shutter and that one blurry face is distracting.', '2007-02-14 19:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367258, 468410, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections - the technicals of this are pretty good - good focus and lighting, but the positions of the guitar seems too far to the right - I really would like to see more of the soundboard and sound hole.</td>', 'Nice use of reflections - the technicals of this are pretty good - good focus and lighting, but the positions of the guitar seems too far to the right - I really would like to see more of the soundboard and sound hole.', '2007-02-14 19:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367264, 465450, 67152, '<td valign="top">For this image to really jump, it would be great to have a musician in the background playing or singing or doing something.  THe electronics by themselves seems a little non-personal.</td>', 'For this image to really jump, it would be great to have a musician in the background playing or singing or doing something.  THe electronics by themselves seems a little non-personal.', '2007-02-14 19:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367265, 467132, 18738, '<td valign="top">Great mood. His hand is clenched and there''s a strong line going up to the face.</td>', 'Great mood. His hand is clenched and there''s a strong line going up to the face.', '2007-02-14 19:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367270, 465319, 67152, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful instrument - Nice colors.  Technically it could use a little sharper focus and could also use some connection to ''school days'' to really score well.  6</td>', 'It''s a beautiful instrument - Nice colors.  Technically it could use a little sharper focus and could also use some connection to ''school days'' to really score well.  6', '2007-02-14 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367274, 467465, 68109, '<td valign="top">Some might argue this tight crop but I would like it if you left more black on either side.  Maybe 375px W 640px H and also if the top wasn''t chopped.  Otherwise I like it, but did you selectively mask the guitar?  Thats a no go in basic.</td>', 'Some might argue this tight crop but I would like it if you left more black on either side.  Maybe 375px W 640px H and also if the top wasn''t chopped.  Otherwise I like it, but did you selectively mask the guitar?  Thats a no go in basic.', '2007-02-14 19:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367276, 468671, 18738, '<td valign="top">Good flow to the music in the background, I appreciate that it looks like running water, but I can''t help feeling that the photo is too cold and flat. There''s no warmth or texture to the violin and and flaws in the bridge are too obvious.</td>', 'Good flow to the music in the background, I appreciate that it looks like running water, but I can''t help feeling that the photo is too cold and flat. There''s no warmth or texture to the violin and and flaws in the bridge are too obvious.', '2007-02-14 19:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367279, 468300, 67152, '<td valign="top">I think you were trying to go for the reflection of the music on the flute, but the extreme closeup on this flute (pitted with scratches) shows more imperfections that I think you want to show.  Bringing the image out a little to show more of the flute and less of the flaws might help.  Also, there are a couple of dark areas on the music that distract - are they shadows or smudges?</td>', 'I think you were trying to go for the reflection of the music on the flute, but the extreme closeup on this flute (pitted with scratches) shows more imperfections that I think you want to show.  Bringing the image out a little to show more of the flute and less of the flaws might help.  Also, there are a couple of dark areas on the music that distract - are they shadows or smudges?', '2007-02-14 19:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367283, 468689, 18738, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I commend your bravery in entering a photo with more than one blurry person in it.</td>', 'Great capture. I commend your bravery in entering a photo with more than one blurry person in it.', '2007-02-14 19:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367287, 467883, 67152, '<td valign="top">I am not a huge fan of this abstract view.  It is okay technically, but I am not drawn into the image.</td>', 'I am not a huge fan of this abstract view.  It is okay technically, but I am not drawn into the image.', '2007-02-14 19:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367288, 467265, 68109, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, definitely one of the better ones.</td>', 'Cool shot, definitely one of the better ones.', '2007-02-14 19:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367303, 468661, 68109, '<td valign="top">Background is kind of distracting for me. Is it a painting? Also I don''t like the variation in the border size.  Otherwise cool shot.</td>', 'Background is kind of distracting for me. Is it a painting? Also I don''t like the variation in the border size.  Otherwise cool shot.', '2007-02-14 19:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367312, 468548, 68109, '<td valign="top">Basic editing?  I do like the dramatic sky and light rays.</td>', 'Basic editing?  I do like the dramatic sky and light rays.', '2007-02-14 19:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367321, 468518, 73929, '<td valign="top">Much too blurry...</td>', 'Much too blurry...', '2007-02-14 20:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367325, 468661, 73929, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, though I''m not too sure about the backgroung.</td>', 'Awesome lighting, though I''m not too sure about the backgroung.', '2007-02-14 20:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367327, 468173, 49315, '<td valign="top">zoomdak!</td>', 'zoomdak!', '2007-02-14 20:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367328, 465918, 67152, '<td valign="top">Decent composition, okay lighting, not very exciting image. 5</td>', 'Decent composition, okay lighting, not very exciting image. 5', '2007-02-14 20:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367335, 468206, 67152, '<td valign="top">Personally, the texture of the background is a distraction - although the line and placement of the silhouette are done nicely.</td>', 'Personally, the texture of the background is a distraction - although the line and placement of the silhouette are done nicely.', '2007-02-14 20:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367339, 468325, 67152, '<td valign="top">The perspective on the keys is pretty good - but there is a shadow from the lens cap or camera and blown out sections on the keys that take away from the image.</td>', 'The perspective on the keys is pretty good - but there is a shadow from the lens cap or camera and blown out sections on the keys that take away from the image.', '2007-02-14 20:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367340, 467835, 67152, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the motion in th is image - even though I think it is likely intentional.</td>', 'I don''t like the motion in th is image - even though I think it is likely intentional.', '2007-02-14 20:12:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3367343, 467671, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice sentiment - the pinkish/ red hue is interesting and the posters in the background are a nice touch - I just don''t like the pole/ mike stand on the right side of the image.</td>', 'Nice sentiment - the pinkish/ red hue is interesting and the posters in the background are a nice touch - I just don''t like the pole/ mike stand on the right side of the image.', '2007-02-14 20:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367348, 468616, 67152, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this (illuminated on the black lacquer instead of the keys) could use some re-positioning to help balance it out.</td>', 'The lighting on this (illuminated on the black lacquer instead of the keys) could use some re-positioning to help balance it out.', '2007-02-14 20:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367356, 465556, 67152, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract view of the guitar.  The light plays nicely off the frets.</td>', 'Interesting abstract view of the guitar.  The light plays nicely off the frets.', '2007-02-14 20:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367362, 468188, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice soft feel of this image - the earth tones work well.</td>', 'Nice soft feel of this image - the earth tones work well.', '2007-02-14 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367364, 467671, 73414, '<td valign="top">Luv it.</td>', 'Luv it.', '2007-02-14 20:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367365, 468548, 69102, '<td valign="top">cool image. not sure how you did this in basic editing.</td>', 'cool image. not sure how you did this in basic editing.', '2007-02-14 20:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367370, 467607, 73414, '<td valign="top">I am in love with this. Uh! Simply stellar!</td>', 'I am in love with this. Uh! Simply stellar!', '2007-02-14 20:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367373, 467468, 70299, '<td valign="top">The wrinkles are a little distracting....Nice shot though! The lighting is really nice except that it''s a little harsh in some spots.</td>', 'The wrinkles are a little distracting....Nice shot though! The lighting is really nice except that it''s a little harsh in some spots.', '2007-02-14 20:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367385, 467132, 70299, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Good lighting!</td>', 'Nice shot!  Good lighting!', '2007-02-14 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367389, 468618, 70299, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice picture.  It''s hard to see the headphones, though, which would be the subject of the picture according to the theme.  And I don''t understand the title.</td>', 'This is a really nice picture.  It''s hard to see the headphones, though, which would be the subject of the picture according to the theme.  And I don''t understand the title.', '2007-02-14 20:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367393, 468650, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice solid image - good lighting on the face and nice sharpness and contrast. 6</td>', 'Nice solid image - good lighting on the face and nice sharpness and contrast. 6', '2007-02-14 20:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367395, 468329, 67152, '<td valign="top">The majority of the horn is really well illuminated but the bell is too blown out for my taste.  I think a slightly different angle of the horn to fill up more of the frame would help.</td>', 'The majority of the horn is really well illuminated but the bell is too blown out for my taste.  I think a slightly different angle of the horn to fill up more of the frame would help.', '2007-02-14 20:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
