(3368574, 467847, 31403, '<td valign="top">feels like this needs whiter whites - simplifying the composition would work better for voters here too I think</td>', 'feels like this needs whiter whites - simplifying the composition would work better for voters here too I think', '2007-02-15 08:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368577, 468548, 70661, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Love the concept, love the colors, great take on the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this. Love the concept, love the colors, great take on the challenge.', '2007-02-15 08:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368587, 467563, 31403, '<td valign="top">nice creative, more dramatic lighting would make this very strong, deeper contrast would help it overall.<br/> <br/>I generally don''t comment on titles, but this one irks me. Feels like you want to show you know more than me, then explain it for the dumber people in the viewing audience.  I don''t vote on titles at all - it won''t affect your score from me - but there''s my initial response for you!  :-)</td>', 'nice creative, more dramatic lighting would make this very strong, deeper contrast would help it overall. I generally don''t comment on titles, but this one irks me. Feels like you want to show you know more than me, then explain it for the dumber people in the viewing audience.  I don''t vote on titles at all - it won''t affect your score from me - but there''s my initial response for you!  :-)', '2007-02-15 08:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368594, 468637, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool concept - really cool.  The handcuffs kind of get lost in this composition though.  If she''s a slave to the music maybe just the hand and the cuffs and the instrument are enough to convey that conceptually.  Really nice lighting - I know how hard it is to control those highlights - nice job</td>', 'cool concept - really cool.  The handcuffs kind of get lost in this composition though.  If she''s a slave to the music maybe just the hand and the cuffs and the instrument are enough to convey that conceptually.  Really nice lighting - I know how hard it is to control those highlights - nice job', '2007-02-15 08:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368597, 468645, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool textures, nice lighting - are the sticks broken?</td>', 'cool textures, nice lighting - are the sticks broken?', '2007-02-15 08:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368598, 467468, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the texture of this, the blown out section on the paper and background is unfortunate - with that under control this is a 9 in my book.  7 as is - nice work</td>', 'love the texture of this, the blown out section on the paper and background is unfortunate - with that under control this is a 9 in my book.  7 as is - nice work', '2007-02-15 08:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368624, 467465, 31403, '<td valign="top">the light is just too hot at the top there - not quite sure what naked girls have to do with school days - but it''s been a while since I''ve been in school :-)  7</td>', 'the light is just too hot at the top there - not quite sure what naked girls have to do with school days - but it''s been a while since I''ve been in school :-)  7', '2007-02-15 08:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368637, 467847, 67671, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, and the way you have laid it out, but the hand with the pen, looks out of place on a page that looks full, and is half covered with a book.</td>', 'I like the shot, and the way you have laid it out, but the hand with the pen, looks out of place on a page that looks full, and is half covered with a book.', '2007-02-15 08:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368640, 468206, 31403, '<td valign="top">wrinkles are pretty distracting</td>', 'wrinkles are pretty distracting', '2007-02-15 08:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368646, 468256, 31403, '<td valign="top">tangled cord is very visually confusing - white space pulls my eye in to the emptiest part of the photo</td>', 'tangled cord is very visually confusing - white space pulls my eye in to the emptiest part of the photo', '2007-02-15 08:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368651, 466316, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh that is clever -</td>', 'oh that is clever -', '2007-02-15 08:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368652, 465608, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool cake - a little light spill on the background would help it stand out a little more</td>', 'cool cake - a little light spill on the background would help it stand out a little more', '2007-02-15 08:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368695, 465846, 67152, '<td valign="top">Interesting closeup on some old brass instruments. Nice warm colors and the OOF valves on the trumpet (?) in the background are a nice touch.   Back for a bump for the colors and set up.  8</td>', 'Interesting closeup on some old brass instruments. Nice warm colors and the OOF valves on the trumpet (?) in the background are a nice touch.   Back for a bump for the colors and set up.  8', '2007-02-15 09:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368697, 468560, 67671, '<td valign="top">Well done, imo, this is one of the best shots here, very expressive, nicely exposed, and sharp, great composition.<br/>only thing is the frame, imo, the better the shot, the less need for a frame, frames can enhance a lesser quality shot, yet somehow be distracting in a really good one, may be better without the white line, this is only my opinion, and I wont give a lower vote for it.<br/>Excellent work. 10</td>', 'Well done, imo, this is one of the best shots here, very expressive, nicely exposed, and sharp, great composition.only thing is the frame, imo, the better the shot, the less need for a frame, frames can enhance a lesser quality shot, yet somehow be distracting in a really good one, may be better without the white line, this is only my opinion, and I wont give a lower vote for it.Excellent work. 10', '2007-02-15 09:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368701, 466796, 67671, '<td valign="top">I bet she sounds great as well, backed by the sounds of the wild life, and the rusteling grass in the breeze, excelent shot, love the comp, 10</td>', 'I bet she sounds great as well, backed by the sounds of the wild life, and the rusteling grass in the breeze, excelent shot, love the comp, 10', '2007-02-15 09:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368717, 468194, 67152, '<td valign="top">There is nothing wrong with the concept of this image, but I would have liked to see a bit more of teh xylophone.</td>', 'There is nothing wrong with the concept of this image, but I would have liked to see a bit more of teh xylophone.', '2007-02-15 09:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368723, 468202, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and energy in the shot, but the angle displayed with only a side view of the drummer doesnt seem to highlight the music part.</td>', 'I like the colors and energy in the shot, but the angle displayed with only a side view of the drummer doesnt seem to highlight the music part.', '2007-02-15 09:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368727, 467847, 67152, '<td valign="top">The set up is pretty good - but I think it just seems so forced with all the stuff in the image - especially wih the individual writing on a piece of paper that is under a book on a page that is already filled up.  In addition, the lighting is a little flat - it needs more contrast and better color adjustment to make the apple etc.</td>', 'The set up is pretty good - but I think it just seems so forced with all the stuff in the image - especially wih the individual writing on a piece of paper that is under a book on a page that is already filled up.  In addition, the lighting is a little flat - it needs more contrast and better color adjustment to make the apple etc.', '2007-02-15 09:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368729, 466388, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good set up of of a photo - i like the low angle on the music, bu tthe lighting on the recorder is too dark and you really can''t see the finger holes and other details very well.  Adjusting the focus so the recorder is tight in focus woudl probably help.</td>', 'This is a pretty good set up of of a photo - i like the low angle on the music, bu tthe lighting on the recorder is too dark and you really can''t see the finger holes and other details very well.  Adjusting the focus so the recorder is tight in focus woudl probably help.', '2007-02-15 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368738, 467989, 67152, '<td valign="top">Oh, to be in HS again....  It is amazing how a guitar, a couple of Eagles songs, and a girl can make a Saturday night into a party.  Great concept for a photo, but I really don''t like the lighting of this much - the underwear has some strange shadows on it and the focus could be a little sharper.  It is strange, but it almost seems that the background is in focus and the guitar and the unmentionable is OOF.</td>', 'Oh, to be in HS again....  It is amazing how a guitar, a couple of Eagles songs, and a girl can make a Saturday night into a party.  Great concept for a photo, but I really don''t like the lighting of this much - the underwear has some strange shadows on it and the focus could be a little sharper.  It is strange, but it almost seems that the background is in focus and the guitar and the unmentionable is OOF.', '2007-02-15 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368747, 466388, 71951, '<td valign="top">Too Dark, a lighter color background I think would have emphasized your subject more.</td>', 'Too Dark, a lighter color background I think would have emphasized your subject more.', '2007-02-15 09:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368754, 468204, 71951, '<td valign="top">The piano has nice lighting but the hand I feel is overexposed.</td>', 'The piano has nice lighting but the hand I feel is overexposed.', '2007-02-15 09:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368756, 468671, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective.  I think this may have worked better in B/W.  The colors from the strings are a little distraction.  There is a great deal of good light and reflective surfaces going on in the photo from the soundboard of the instrument and the bridge has interesting detail and B/W with good contrast would probably help bring it out more.  <br/> <br/>Maybe a slightly wider shot would also help, showing the connection of the strings to the soundboard.  Another thing that might help is having the horizon more at 1/3 from the bottom rather than at ~20%.</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective.  I think this may have worked better in B/W.  The colors from the strings are a little distraction.  There is a great deal of good light and reflective surfaces going on in the photo from the soundboard of the instrument and the bridge has interesting detail and B/W with good contrast would probably help bring it out more.   Maybe a slightly wider shot would also help, showing the connection of the strings to the soundboard.  Another thing that might help is having the horizon more at 1/3 from the bottom rather than at ~20%.', '2007-02-15 09:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368757, 466512, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I almost submitted a similar one.</td>', 'Nice photo, I almost submitted a similar one.', '2007-02-15 09:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368761, 465515, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea.  I''m not sure about your choice for the in-focus part.  It doesn''t seem to have a real compelling reason for focusing on that part of the strings.</td>', 'This is a cool idea.  I''m not sure about your choice for the in-focus part.  It doesn''t seem to have a real compelling reason for focusing on that part of the strings.', '2007-02-15 09:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368762, 465288, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting from behind.  The ''concentration'' on the face is displayed pretty good.  The only problem is that I had to really look to find the iPOD - staging it more may have helped a bit more.</td>', 'Nice lighting from behind.  The ''concentration'' on the face is displayed pretty good.  The only problem is that I had to really look to find the iPOD - staging it more may have helped a bit more.', '2007-02-15 09:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368763, 468297, 7504, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice in foucs here.  I guess it''s a bit hard on the eyes having so much of it out of focus, but maybe that''s because I''m trying to read the music!  : )</td>', 'Interesting choice in foucs here.  I guess it''s a bit hard on the eyes having so much of it out of focus, but maybe that''s because I''m trying to read the music!  : )', '2007-02-15 09:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368766, 468325, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the shadow in the forefront is distracting.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the shadow in the forefront is distracting.', '2007-02-15 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368768, 468612, 7504, '<td valign="top">Nice guitar, not sure why the main part of your subject seems to be the pickup.  Lovely tones in this.</td>', 'Nice guitar, not sure why the main part of your subject seems to be the pickup.  Lovely tones in this.', '2007-02-15 09:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368772, 466886, 7504, '<td valign="top">I love this, the sneakers are awesome.  It reminds me of all those years in band, the bass clarinet folks were a rare breed.  : )</td>', 'I love this, the sneakers are awesome.  It reminds me of all those years in band, the bass clarinet folks were a rare breed.  : )', '2007-02-15 09:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368775, 466586, 67152, '<td valign="top">A nice effort.  The illumination from the iPOD seems a bit blown out compared to the CDs around the photo.  A little better lighting on the CDS so that the exposure could be adjusted would probably help this.</td>', 'A nice effort.  The illumination from the iPOD seems a bit blown out compared to the CDs around the photo.  A little better lighting on the CDS so that the exposure could be adjusted would probably help this.', '2007-02-15 09:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368777, 467835, 7504, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I can see what you''re trying to do here, a bit confusing, but I see you''ve got the pendulum almost in focus.</td>', 'Hmm, I can see what you''re trying to do here, a bit confusing, but I see you''ve got the pendulum almost in focus.', '2007-02-15 09:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368778, 468567, 7504, '<td valign="top">Nice sillouette.  Don''t know how to spell that though, or is it a shadow?  Anyway well done.</td>', 'Nice sillouette.  Don''t know how to spell that though, or is it a shadow?  Anyway well done.', '2007-02-15 09:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368781, 465319, 7504, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s a beauty.  I like the DOF here, nicely done.</td>', 'Oh, that''s a beauty.  I like the DOF here, nicely done.', '2007-02-15 09:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368782, 468049, 67152, '<td valign="top">The set up of the photo is pretty good - especially the drum and hat.  But, this image seems a little fuzzy and the lighting with the sharp shadows is not very flattering to the cool drum.  I woudl love to see more detail on the drum - sharpening and improved light might help out.</td>', 'The set up of the photo is pretty good - especially the drum and hat.  But, this image seems a little fuzzy and the lighting with the sharp shadows is not very flattering to the cool drum.  I woudl love to see more detail on the drum - sharpening and improved light might help out.', '2007-02-15 09:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368783, 468300, 7504, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a little more contrast here, but I really like the idea of this pic.  Of course I''m flute player myself!</td>', 'I''d like to see a little more contrast here, but I really like the idea of this pic.  Of course I''m flute player myself!', '2007-02-15 09:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368792, 468476, 67152, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice set up for a shot (and very funny sign) - but the saturation really seems off - the mortar on the brickwork looks purple to me and the rest of the image has a strong orangish tone on my monitor.</td>', 'Pretty nice set up for a shot (and very funny sign) - but the saturation really seems off - the mortar on the brickwork looks purple to me and the rest of the image has a strong orangish tone on my monitor.', '2007-02-15 09:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368794, 466687, 7504, '<td valign="top">Looks like a B to me (I mean the note she''s playing).  I''m feeling like it being off kilter is a bit bothersome, but I can see what you''re going for here.</td>', 'Looks like a B to me (I mean the note she''s playing).  I''m feeling like it being off kilter is a bit bothersome, but I can see what you''re going for here.', '2007-02-15 09:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368795, 467501, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, nice candid capture.</td>', 'This is lovely, nice candid capture.', '2007-02-15 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368797, 468518, 67152, '<td valign="top">This bell seems completely out of focus.  It has a lot of cool detail to it, but we can''t see it.</td>', 'This bell seems completely out of focus.  It has a lot of cool detail to it, but we can''t see it.', '2007-02-15 09:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368799, 467225, 7504, '<td valign="top">I feel that way sometimes too!  I really like the contrast in this shot.</td>', 'I feel that way sometimes too!  I really like the contrast in this shot.', '2007-02-15 09:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368802, 468173, 7504, '<td valign="top">I feel this way sometimes too!  Nicely done, great idea here.</td>', 'I feel this way sometimes too!  Nicely done, great idea here.', '2007-02-15 09:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368805, 468303, 59121, '<td valign="top">Like composition!</td>', 'Like composition!', '2007-02-15 09:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368807, 467292, 7504, '<td valign="top">The flash off the glass is a bit bothersome.  This might''ve been nice in B&amp;W.  Nice guitars!!</td>', 'The flash off the glass is a bit bothersome.  This might''ve been nice in B&W.  Nice guitars!!', '2007-02-15 09:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368809, 465988, 7504, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked to see a little more contrast here, I like it though!</td>', 'I would''ve liked to see a little more contrast here, I like it though!', '2007-02-15 09:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368813, 465723, 7504, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  Fun idea, but I imagine you''re getting whacked for it.</td>', 'Ha ha!  Fun idea, but I imagine you''re getting whacked for it.', '2007-02-15 09:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368815, 468518, 74115, '<td valign="top">This would be better if it were focused.</td>', 'This would be better if it were focused.', '2007-02-15 09:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368816, 468568, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like his focus.  You might''ve done better if you hadn''t used a flash for this shot, or moved your subject away from the wall to avoid that annoying flash shadow.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like his focus.  You might''ve done better if you hadn''t used a flash for this shot, or moved your subject away from the wall to avoid that annoying flash shadow.  Good luck!', '2007-02-15 09:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368818, 468692, 71951, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.</td>', 'Very nice photo.', '2007-02-15 09:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368819, 466816, 7504, '<td valign="top">This guitar is a beaut.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This guitar is a beaut.  Nicely done.', '2007-02-15 09:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368825, 467465, 7504, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''re trying to do here, I wish your upper arm wasn''t so "hot" with the lighting.  This is really a work of art!</td>', 'I really like what you''re trying to do here, I wish your upper arm wasn''t so "hot" with the lighting.  This is really a work of art!', '2007-02-15 09:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368828, 465676, 7504, '<td valign="top">This needs sharper focus, in my opinion.</td>', 'This needs sharper focus, in my opinion.', '2007-02-15 09:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
