(3370232, 468605, 20330, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this image, the detail of the side of the drum and the drum sticks, and I like the dof. The red reflection in the drum makes the image stand out. It relates to school (to me) because I only see drums in school bands or orchestra''s, not too many people have them lying around the house as a hobby (like guitars for instance). Cool Dude :)</td>', 'I love the lighting in this image, the detail of the side of the drum and the drum sticks, and I like the dof. The red reflection in the drum makes the image stand out. It relates to school (to me) because I only see drums in school bands or orchestra''s, not too many people have them lying around the house as a hobby (like guitars for instance). Cool Dude :)', '2007-02-15 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
