(3371207, 468200, 20102, '<td valign="top">she won''t get first chair while sleeping! :)</td>', 'she won''t get first chair while sleeping! :)', '2007-02-15 22:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3371284, 468326, 66524, '<td valign="top">Beautiful faces!...and all the elements of a "school" classroom ( see background, arguably "busy").  The photo is very "real" and given the various directions toward which the children are looking, I think it keeps the viewer interested in the photo, one child after the another.  Great story telling and while it lacks all the "slick" post processing skills we compete against - you nailed this one on its own merit. I hope you do well - 10!  I assume you are a teacher?</td>', 'Beautiful faces!...and all the elements of a "school" classroom ( see background, arguably "busy").  The photo is very "real" and given the various directions toward which the children are looking, I think it keeps the viewer interested in the photo, one child after the another.  Great story telling and while it lacks all the "slick" post processing skills we compete against - you nailed this one on its own merit. I hope you do well - 10!  I assume you are a teacher?', '2007-02-15 22:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3371318, 467204, 66524, '<td valign="top">I thought "a teacher''s guiding hand", but if you like "soft touch", fine.  I wouldn''t know C-Minor of it bumped into me, but you have a lovely photo and a charming interpretation - great focus (I think they call it DOF)and great lighting. I have been staring at the child''s hand with highlights and the adult''s fingers with highlights - hence my preference for my title ;) BTW the ring is in no way distracting  I aspire to your vision...10</td>', 'I thought "a teacher''s guiding hand", but if you like "soft touch", fine.  I wouldn''t know C-Minor of it bumped into me, but you have a lovely photo and a charming interpretation - great focus (I think they call it DOF)and great lighting. I have been staring at the child''s hand with highlights and the adult''s fingers with highlights - hence my preference for my title ;) BTW the ring is in no way distracting  I aspire to your vision...10', '2007-02-15 23:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3371330, 466719, 66524, '<td valign="top">Your photo is from a car show!  The title carries it - that''s no parking lot. I do admire your spin on the challenge.</td>', 'Your photo is from a car show!  The title carries it - that''s no parking lot. I do admire your spin on the challenge.', '2007-02-15 23:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
