(3373496, 467833, 52731, '<td valign="top">That little smattering of fabric detail on the bottom right is fantastic. I love everything about this shot, the shallow DOF, the moody tones, everything just fits together wonderfully.</td>', 'That little smattering of fabric detail on the bottom right is fantastic. I love everything about this shot, the shallow DOF, the moody tones, everything just fits together wonderfully.', '2007-02-16 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
