(3373500, 467265, 52731, '<td valign="top">Love the moody lighting. I like that you''ve taken the chance with the unusal composition with him facing out of the frame and through the railing. The risks paid off in my opinion, good work.</td>', 'Love the moody lighting. I like that you''ve taken the chance with the unusal composition with him facing out of the frame and through the railing. The risks paid off in my opinion, good work.', '2007-02-16 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
