(3374569, 465392, 48471, '<td valign="top">A very good study. I wish the instrument was more in focus. Still, one of the best in the challenge.<br/>I need the ear in this shot, but I''m afraid that people first will look at the eye. I wish the ear was more emphasized... <br/>Maybe it''s better the way the ear is, because, once you find it after spending time looking, you get your reward.<br/>And, I hope you don''t mind if I ask for a female model for the next try of this shot.</td>', 'A very good study. I wish the instrument was more in focus. Still, one of the best in the challenge.I need the ear in this shot, but I''m afraid that people first will look at the eye. I wish the ear was more emphasized... Maybe it''s better the way the ear is, because, once you find it after spending time looking, you get your reward.And, I hope you don''t mind if I ask for a female model for the next try of this shot.', '2007-02-17 07:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374572, 468548, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The title adds to the understanding.</td>', 'Good idea. The title adds to the understanding.', '2007-02-17 07:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374602, 468662, 48471, '<td valign="top">The background is too noisy!!!<br/>:-) Well, just to let you know that I can see the lamp-like thing hanging over the head, as well as the window frame on the left. Still, a very good idea and execution.</td>', 'The background is too noisy!!!:-) Well, just to let you know that I can see the lamp-like thing hanging over the head, as well as the window frame on the left. Still, a very good idea and execution.', '2007-02-17 07:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374606, 468410, 67553, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and well composed.</td>', 'Nice idea, and well composed.', '2007-02-17 07:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374609, 468329, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I guess I needed more work. For example, I think the flash reflected from the horn is so bad. <br/>I like the feel of the background.</td>', 'Good idea, but I guess I needed more work. For example, I think the flash reflected from the horn is so bad. I like the feel of the background.', '2007-02-17 07:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374610, 465288, 67553, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been helped by a more prominent positioning of the iPod.</td>', 'I think this would have been helped by a more prominent positioning of the iPod.', '2007-02-17 07:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374615, 468692, 67553, '<td valign="top">Great colors and texture.  Well composed.</td>', 'Great colors and texture.  Well composed.', '2007-02-17 07:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374618, 468676, 67553, '<td valign="top">This could be a bit sharper on the bottom.  Overall, it looks a little oof.  Nice subject, though.</td>', 'This could be a bit sharper on the bottom.  Overall, it looks a little oof.  Nice subject, though.', '2007-02-17 07:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374621, 466690, 67553, '<td valign="top">Great job on the lighting.</td>', 'Great job on the lighting.', '2007-02-17 07:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374625, 468384, 67553, '<td valign="top">That''s kind of cool.  I''m hoping to find out what this is after the challenge.  Overall, your lighting makes this one look a little drab, though.</td>', 'That''s kind of cool.  I''m hoping to find out what this is after the challenge.  Overall, your lighting makes this one look a little drab, though.', '2007-02-17 07:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374628, 468325, 67553, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and good composition.  The shadow on the first two keys is distracting, though.</td>', 'Nice idea, and good composition.  The shadow on the first two keys is distracting, though.', '2007-02-17 07:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374630, 468614, 67553, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of perspective.  You''ve managed to stand out from the crowd in that regard.</td>', 'Nice choice of perspective.  You''ve managed to stand out from the crowd in that regard.', '2007-02-17 07:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374634, 468173, 48471, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! This guy is about to grab music! I love the shadows and how they have the same tone as the notes...</td>', 'WOW!!! This guy is about to grab music! I love the shadows and how they have the same tone as the notes...', '2007-02-17 07:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374635, 465723, 67553, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to get this one.  That''s kinda funny.  :)</td>', 'It took me a minute to get this one.  That''s kinda funny.  :)', '2007-02-17 07:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374637, 467227, 56005, '<td valign="top">I would give it a 10 if the background were different.</td>', 'I would give it a 10 if the background were different.', '2007-02-17 07:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374645, 465550, 48471, '<td valign="top">Well, your shallow focus shows me only one of the players, not the line. The title and the mike are on the way to this becoming a very good photo.</td>', 'Well, your shallow focus shows me only one of the players, not the line. The title and the mike are on the way to this becoming a very good photo.', '2007-02-17 08:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374647, 467989, 48471, '<td valign="top">I want to believe!</td>', 'I want to believe!', '2007-02-17 08:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374649, 468188, 48471, '<td valign="top">Curtains, the pillow and bed cover, her dress fit so nicely. As for her and the music, it''s lost in this image of textile, in my opinion. Good pose, though...</td>', 'Curtains, the pillow and bed cover, her dress fit so nicely. As for her and the music, it''s lost in this image of textile, in my opinion. Good pose, though...', '2007-02-17 08:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374654, 466358, 48471, '<td valign="top">Cool kid...</td>', 'Cool kid...', '2007-02-17 08:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374658, 467265, 48471, '<td valign="top">Moody...</td>', 'Moody...', '2007-02-17 08:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374667, 468479, 48471, '<td valign="top">Why such a heavy title for such a mediocre photo? Where am I to find notes of revolution in this image? Is the guitar that instrument of revolution? Well, it''s also the instrument of country music, which isn''t revolutionary at all... Maybe it''s revolutionary because it is electric, hence rock and roll... But, weren''t the lyrics the true instruments of revolution?<br/>A simpler title might have helped this photo.</td>', 'Why such a heavy title for such a mediocre photo? Where am I to find notes of revolution in this image? Is the guitar that instrument of revolution? Well, it''s also the instrument of country music, which isn''t revolutionary at all... Maybe it''s revolutionary because it is electric, hence rock and roll... But, weren''t the lyrics the true instruments of revolution?A simpler title might have helped this photo.', '2007-02-17 08:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374806, 467658, 73601, '<td valign="top">good idea and composition but a bit burry</td>', 'good idea and composition but a bit burry', '2007-02-17 10:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374809, 468476, 73601, '<td valign="top">amusing sign</td>', 'amusing sign', '2007-02-17 10:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374815, 466687, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice capture of the the girl watching, I would of cropped this a little tighter</td>', 'nice capture of the the girl watching, I would of cropped this a little tighter', '2007-02-17 10:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374825, 468049, 73601, '<td valign="top">a bit blurry and the color seems a tad bland</td>', 'a bit blurry and the color seems a tad bland', '2007-02-17 10:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374832, 465645, 73601, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the lighting</td>', 'I like the composition and the lighting', '2007-02-17 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
