(3375025, 466690, 74219, '<td valign="top">gahhh so cute! i love the image and idea and wow. very awesome composition and the lighting works really well.</td>', 'gahhh so cute! i love the image and idea and wow. very awesome composition and the lighting works really well.', '2007-02-17 11:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375028, 466542, 74219, '<td valign="top">wonderful idea. did you use a projector to get that on her back? i think if the image was a tad bit softer, you would get a very nice flow from her back to the piano keys. the keys seem to be the sharper focus whereas the model''s back is somewhat grainy. but nonetheless, it is a powerful image. great job =)</td>', 'wonderful idea. did you use a projector to get that on her back? i think if the image was a tad bit softer, you would get a very nice flow from her back to the piano keys. the keys seem to be the sharper focus whereas the model''s back is somewhat grainy. but nonetheless, it is a powerful image. great job =)', '2007-02-17 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375097, 466586, 48471, '<td valign="top">I would love to read why you took this photo and what you wanted to communicate... As it is, I can''t see anything interesting in it: an iPod with some CD covers. Why do you think I, as a viewer, should care and spend time looking at this photo? What am I supposed to see here, except from your collection (mine, by the way is bigger and better)?<br/>These lines were just a rationale of my voting.</td>', 'I would love to read why you took this photo and what you wanted to communicate... As it is, I can''t see anything interesting in it: an iPod with some CD covers. Why do you think I, as a viewer, should care and spend time looking at this photo? What am I supposed to see here, except from your collection (mine, by the way is bigger and better)?These lines were just a rationale of my voting.', '2007-02-17 11:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375110, 468679, 48471, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this photo. Is it trying to tell me that the modern instruments are the CDs? I also don''t know what is the role of the colours...</td>', 'I don''t understand this photo. Is it trying to tell me that the modern instruments are the CDs? I also don''t know what is the role of the colours...', '2007-02-17 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375132, 468256, 48471, '<td valign="top">I find this photo a forced try to fit the challenge, in the sense that there''s a blackboard and a sponge and an MP3 player. So, there are the school and music elements. But, is there a composition that commands attention, that begs for thought? I don''t think so... Does this photo evoke any memory, thought, laugh, any undefined interest? Call me bad and blind and soulless, but it doesn''t...<br/>I find this to be a boring and uninspiring photo, lacking also from the technical point (very colourless)...</td>', 'I find this photo a forced try to fit the challenge, in the sense that there''s a blackboard and a sponge and an MP3 player. So, there are the school and music elements. But, is there a composition that commands attention, that begs for thought? I don''t think so... Does this photo evoke any memory, thought, laugh, any undefined interest? Call me bad and blind and soulless, but it doesn''t...I find this to be a boring and uninspiring photo, lacking also from the technical point (very colourless)...', '2007-02-17 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
