(3381532, 468650, 54885, '<td valign="top">To some people this will be called a snapshot, I am guilty of taking snapshots myself. This is a great pose and I like the fact that the model is not centered, but the photo needs just a tad more lighting and more clarity.I still beleive that this photo deserves a 5 or higher.</td>', 'To some people this will be called a snapshot, I am guilty of taking snapshots myself. This is a great pose and I like the fact that the model is not centered, but the photo needs just a tad more lighting and more clarity.I still beleive that this photo deserves a 5 or higher.', '2007-02-19 13:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381547, 468676, 54885, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea but I think the photo needs a little more focus(clarity)The object appears a little out of focus. And maybe a little more lighting but not too much. I love the lighting at the bottom of the guitar, but the lighting would look good with a little wider spectrum.</td>', 'This is a great idea but I think the photo needs a little more focus(clarity)The object appears a little out of focus. And maybe a little more lighting but not too much. I love the lighting at the bottom of the guitar, but the lighting would look good with a little wider spectrum.', '2007-02-19 13:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381744, 468673, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Interesting to look at, nice color tone to it, a natural grainyness (sp?) that adds character.  You covered the school and music bases very well here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this.  Interesting to look at, nice color tone to it, a natural grainyness (sp?) that adds character.  You covered the school and music bases very well here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-19 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381749, 468606, 30049, '<td valign="top">Kids today can do anything with an ear bud in, can''t they?  :D  I like your approach to the challenge theme.  This would have worked maybe a little better with the book blurred a tad more.  Just a thought...I still like it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kids today can do anything with an ear bud in, can''t they?  :D  I like your approach to the challenge theme.  This would have worked maybe a little better with the book blurred a tad more.  Just a thought...I still like it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-19 14:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381758, 468662, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like you lost some detail with the noise reduction, not bad, but noticable IMO.  I like the lighting on the subject.  A minor adjustment in curves and that faint glimmer of a doorway would have gone to black, which would help this composition some.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like you lost some detail with the noise reduction, not bad, but noticable IMO.  I like the lighting on the subject.  A minor adjustment in curves and that faint glimmer of a doorway would have gone to black, which would help this composition some.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-19 14:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381763, 468444, 30049, '<td valign="top">A very pretty instrument indeed.</td>', 'A very pretty instrument indeed.', '2007-02-19 14:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381778, 466586, 30049, '<td valign="top">Now if you only had some homework papers showing or something it would tie into the challenge theme.  The blue glow of the lcd panel is spilling over into the black of the player some - a small boost in contrast might help minimize that some?  The colors in this are quite warm (i.e. - the whites aren''t white, they''re yellow) - an adjustment to color temp/white balance could add a lot to this photo IMO.  All JMO or course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Now if you only had some homework papers showing or something it would tie into the challenge theme.  The blue glow of the lcd panel is spilling over into the black of the player some - a small boost in contrast might help minimize that some?  The colors in this are quite warm (i.e. - the whites aren''t white, they''re yellow) - an adjustment to color temp/white balance could add a lot to this photo IMO.  All JMO or course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-19 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381794, 467468, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lighting is way too strong in the center of this composition.  Blowing all the whites out, plus glare on the rim of the middle horn.</td>', 'Lighting is way too strong in the center of this composition.  Blowing all the whites out, plus glare on the rim of the middle horn.', '2007-02-19 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381907, 468205, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections and lighting, but the overall composition seems a bit boring... perhaps a bit more of a tilt to the instrument?</td>', 'Nice reflections and lighting, but the overall composition seems a bit boring... perhaps a bit more of a tilt to the instrument?', '2007-02-19 14:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381911, 468303, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the unique perspective here!</td>', 'I like the unique perspective here!', '2007-02-19 14:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381928, 467811, 47852, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is shallow!  The edges of the keys seem a bit jagged, but overall this is a creative shot with a nice composition.</td>', 'Now THAT is shallow!  The edges of the keys seem a bit jagged, but overall this is a creative shot with a nice composition.', '2007-02-19 15:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381972, 468645, 64446, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2007-02-19 15:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381981, 468206, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry in the silhouette and I like the lighting, wish the background was a bit smoother though.</td>', 'Great symmetry in the silhouette and I like the lighting, wish the background was a bit smoother though.', '2007-02-19 15:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381989, 468202, 71931, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I lowered my vote as it doesn''t address the theme.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I lowered my vote as it doesn''t address the theme.', '2007-02-19 15:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381991, 467468, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wind instruments?  Aren''t those clarinets, flutes and saxes?  Either way, nice tones, but just a bit too blown out on the highlights.  Wish the background had less wrinkles in it too.  This is one of those shots that just needed a few small details ironed out (no pun intended) to be one of the top contenders.</td>', 'Wind instruments?  Aren''t those clarinets, flutes and saxes?  Either way, nice tones, but just a bit too blown out on the highlights.  Wish the background had less wrinkles in it too.  This is one of those shots that just needed a few small details ironed out (no pun intended) to be one of the top contenders.', '2007-02-19 15:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381994, 468325, 47852, '<td valign="top">Completely lost the lines between the keys in the blown out area, but it''s a nice perspective and I like how you captured a lot of keys in the shot.</td>', 'Completely lost the lines between the keys in the blown out area, but it''s a nice perspective and I like how you captured a lot of keys in the shot.', '2007-02-19 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381999, 468692, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the square crop with the diagonal clarinet... nice lighting too.</td>', 'I like the square crop with the diagonal clarinet... nice lighting too.', '2007-02-19 15:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382064, 467451, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the expression.. I''m sure many parents see that every day as their kids are practicing!</td>', 'Love the expression.. I''m sure many parents see that every day as their kids are practicing!', '2007-02-19 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382117, 468303, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and lighting!</td>', 'Nice angle and lighting!', '2007-02-19 16:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382452, 467465, 67237, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. I just doubt you are still in school days :)</td>', 'Lovely picture. I just doubt you are still in school days :)', '2007-02-19 17:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382456, 466325, 67237, '<td valign="top">besides the title..I do not see how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'besides the title..I do not see how this fits the challenge.', '2007-02-19 17:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382471, 465248, 67237, '<td valign="top">IMO this is one of the very few fitting the challenge. Well done (8)</td>', 'IMO this is one of the very few fitting the challenge. Well done (8)', '2007-02-19 17:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382480, 468548, 67237, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Nicely executed (9)</td>', 'Very creative. Nicely executed (9)', '2007-02-19 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382488, 468679, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice composition based on basic colors...I wish there was also green</td>', 'nice composition based on basic colors...I wish there was also green', '2007-02-19 17:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382796, 468461, 37845, '<td valign="top">Not that its my place to do really suggest this, but I think a better title would have been "Practice Makes Perfect", because you see the music symbol improving as the student progresses... as a student would also improve with practice.</td>', 'Not that its my place to do really suggest this, but I think a better title would have been "Practice Makes Perfect", because you see the music symbol improving as the student progresses... as a student would also improve with practice.', '2007-02-19 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382806, 467833, 37845, '<td valign="top">I found that a little too much of the photo was out of focus, either that, or I would have preferred a different crop, in which more of the top of the photo is also included.</td>', 'I found that a little too much of the photo was out of focus, either that, or I would have preferred a different crop, in which more of the top of the photo is also included.', '2007-02-19 19:31:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3382836, 468384, 53243, '<td valign="top">slightly too much contrast, but thanks for sharing.</td>', 'slightly too much contrast, but thanks for sharing.', '2007-02-19 19:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382851, 467835, 53243, '<td valign="top">too out of focus</td>', 'too out of focus', '2007-02-19 19:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3382871, 465556, 20608, '<td valign="top">Les Paul maybe? great DOF front and back end with the focus tack sharp in the center.. good choice for B&amp;W good luck with it - 10</td>', 'Les Paul maybe? great DOF front and back end with the focus tack sharp in the center.. good choice for B&W good luck with it - 10', '2007-02-19 19:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383094, 467949, 70375, '<td valign="top">What a cute little face he has :) I love B&amp;W and this photo is no exception. I see a lot of grain and I am going to assume that was intentional. His espression is spot on and the microphone makes him look like a rock star. The unusual angle is nice and made me laugh when I opened it :) Fun shot!</td>', 'What a cute little face he has :) I love B&W and this photo is no exception. I see a lot of grain and I am going to assume that was intentional. His espression is spot on and the microphone makes him look like a rock star. The unusual angle is nice and made me laugh when I opened it :) Fun shot!', '2007-02-19 20:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383104, 465985, 70375, '<td valign="top">I would like this more if both of the girls were in focus I believe. It certainly works for a music challenge and the colours are unbelievable and very sharp and crisp. Those girls look like they are concentrating so hard on the music in front of them too :) Lovely.</td>', 'I would like this more if both of the girls were in focus I believe. It certainly works for a music challenge and the colours are unbelievable and very sharp and crisp. Those girls look like they are concentrating so hard on the music in front of them too :) Lovely.', '2007-02-19 20:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383116, 467607, 70375, '<td valign="top">This B&amp;W is nice and noise free :) I think your model could have looked a bit more "punk" but she is pretty and that certainly doesn''t hurt this shot :) I like the rock wall behind her, it adds a lovely bit of hardness and texture to the composition. I love the different shapes you have going on too... the checks in the guitar strap, the lines on the guitar, and the stripes on her shirt and shorts. Very creative and well composed overall. Plus, it made me smile :)</td>', 'This B&W is nice and noise free :) I think your model could have looked a bit more "punk" but she is pretty and that certainly doesn''t hurt this shot :) I like the rock wall behind her, it adds a lovely bit of hardness and texture to the composition. I love the different shapes you have going on too... the checks in the guitar strap, the lines on the guitar, and the stripes on her shirt and shorts. Very creative and well composed overall. Plus, it made me smile :)', '2007-02-19 20:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383128, 468553, 70375, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely :) I can''t really say more except I want to look at this over and over again. It stirs the music lover (and student) in me. This would be a nice series shot too... different instruments all in the same style with the same angle and appropriate sheets of music :) Nice work!</td>', 'Simply lovely :) I can''t really say more except I want to look at this over and over again. It stirs the music lover (and student) in me. This would be a nice series shot too... different instruments all in the same style with the same angle and appropriate sheets of music :) Nice work!', '2007-02-19 20:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383130, 465550, 70375, '<td valign="top">If I close my ears to everything, looking at this, I can hear the music :)</td>', 'If I close my ears to everything, looking at this, I can hear the music :)', '2007-02-19 20:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383136, 467857, 70375, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet that model rocks this fiddle too! I like the shadows on the wall behind and the way he is crouched down :) Hair and makeup are awesome! Kudos on an excellent shot!</td>', 'I''ll bet that model rocks this fiddle too! I like the shadows on the wall behind and the way he is crouched down :) Hair and makeup are awesome! Kudos on an excellent shot!', '2007-02-19 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383145, 465676, 70375, '<td valign="top">It is a little bit OOF but a great concept! Your lighting is pretty good too. A thought... if you had made the bright spot on the globe hit a specific country, it might make a bolder statement :)</td>', 'It is a little bit OOF but a great concept! Your lighting is pretty good too. A thought... if you had made the bright spot on the globe hit a specific country, it might make a bolder statement :)', '2007-02-19 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383154, 466278, 70375, '<td valign="top">I get this look from my boys every time I tell them to practice their trombone :P  Great focus on the eyes, nice brightness on the trombone. Image makes me feel sorry for the little guy :) That is a good thing :)</td>', 'I get this look from my boys every time I tell them to practice their trombone :P  Great focus on the eyes, nice brightness on the trombone. Image makes me feel sorry for the little guy :) That is a good thing :)', '2007-02-19 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383268, 467989, 43442, '<td valign="top">depth of field too small ( focus )</td>', 'depth of field too small ( focus )', '2007-02-19 21:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383278, 468205, 43442, '<td valign="top">Very very well done........... Hey where is the 20 SCORE !!!!</td>', 'Very very well done........... Hey where is the 20 SCORE !!!!', '2007-02-19 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383334, 465645, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful POV and DOF on this photo.  Sharp and crisp where it counts.  Nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful POV and DOF on this photo.  Sharp and crisp where it counts.  Nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-19 22:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383497, 466542, 74442, '<td valign="top">Very nicely executed. I love the textures.</td>', 'Very nicely executed. I love the textures.', '2007-02-19 23:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383795, 468626, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job. I love how abstract it is. It takes a second to figure out exactly whats going on - and that can make a really great photograph. Good work. I like the colors too.</td>', 'Wow, great job. I love how abstract it is. It takes a second to figure out exactly whats going on - and that can make a really great photograph. Good work. I like the colors too.', '2007-02-20 01:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383798, 468630, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice violin. Mine has a million nicks in it- looks like you just polished! I like the way the bow is places, almost like its getting ready to be played. My only problem would be that the picture all around is kinda dark, but otherwise, great composition!</td>', 'Wow, nice violin. Mine has a million nicks in it- looks like you just polished! I like the way the bow is places, almost like its getting ready to be played. My only problem would be that the picture all around is kinda dark, but otherwise, great composition!', '2007-02-20 01:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
