(3385475, 468645, 2490, '<td valign="top">I get it, but it somehow needs more context to really shine.  Maybe a youth crouched in a corner, blurred a little.  Just a thought. 7</td>', 'I get it, but it somehow needs more context to really shine.  Maybe a youth crouched in a corner, blurred a little.  Just a thought. 7', '2007-02-20 12:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
