(3385488, 468405, 2490, '<td valign="top">Something looks "gritty" here, and I''m a big fan of that.  If it is intentional, it needs to be a little more gritty to make intent obvious.  If it''s NOT intentional, maybe it should be :)  8</td>', 'Something looks "gritty" here, and I''m a big fan of that.  If it is intentional, it needs to be a little more gritty to make intent obvious.  If it''s NOT intentional, maybe it should be :)  8', '2007-02-20 12:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
