(3386361, 466542, 41746, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well captured. Hope you do well. 9.</td>', 'Great idea, well captured. Hope you do well. 9.', '2007-02-20 17:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386488, 465515, 70375, '<td valign="top">Well, one could certainly feel the bass from there! :) I love the way you made the strings look like they are vibrating but still at the same time. Great DOF. Lovin the B&amp;W too.</td>', 'Well, one could certainly feel the bass from there! :) I love the way you made the strings look like they are vibrating but still at the same time. Great DOF. Lovin the B&W too.', '2007-02-20 18:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386494, 466886, 70375, '<td valign="top">The shoes detract a bit and the instrument is not portrayed in the most flattering manner but I see where you were going with this. My first reaction was, "What in the heck?" but I didn''t vote right away and revisited this 3 times because I was trying to understand. Now that I do, I must say, this is an interesting way of getting a point across :)</td>', 'The shoes detract a bit and the instrument is not portrayed in the most flattering manner but I see where you were going with this. My first reaction was, "What in the heck?" but I didn''t vote right away and revisited this 3 times because I was trying to understand. Now that I do, I must say, this is an interesting way of getting a point across :)', '2007-02-20 18:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386499, 468686, 70375, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The chin rest in front is a little bit of a distraction but I can overlook that when the image speaks in such huge volumes :) Nice capture of the grain in the instrument.</td>', 'Beautiful. The chin rest in front is a little bit of a distraction but I can overlook that when the image speaks in such huge volumes :) Nice capture of the grain in the instrument.', '2007-02-20 18:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386506, 468204, 70375, '<td valign="top">Tickle the Ivorys! Goochie Goochie Goo! Sorry, that was the first thing that came to mind... and it made me laugh. I love playing the piano and this image evokes that perfectly. Also, you got me with the B&amp;W :)</td>', 'Tickle the Ivorys! Goochie Goochie Goo! Sorry, that was the first thing that came to mind... and it made me laugh. I love playing the piano and this image evokes that perfectly. Also, you got me with the B&W :)', '2007-02-20 18:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386517, 466325, 70375, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm... This image is a little bit bright for my personal taste but the underlying story is not lost here. The composition is good too. I can''t really see how this fits the challenge as I see no instruments but I suppose it is the music of war that you were portraying here. Anyway, it evoked a strong response and so I vote on that :)</td>', 'Hmmmmm... This image is a little bit bright for my personal taste but the underlying story is not lost here. The composition is good too. I can''t really see how this fits the challenge as I see no instruments but I suppose it is the music of war that you were portraying here. Anyway, it evoked a strong response and so I vote on that :)', '2007-02-20 18:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386518, 468525, 70375, '<td valign="top">Bright spot on the guitar is a little too much. The B&amp;W is nice though :)</td>', 'Bright spot on the guitar is a little too much. The B&W is nice though :)', '2007-02-20 18:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386523, 465450, 70375, '<td valign="top">Sharp, clear, and bright :) Makes me feel like I am back in the theatre ;)</td>', 'Sharp, clear, and bright :) Makes me feel like I am back in the theatre ;)', '2007-02-20 18:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386529, 465319, 70375, '<td valign="top">I like the colour but I am left yearning to see the rest of the guitar.</td>', 'I like the colour but I am left yearning to see the rest of the guitar.', '2007-02-20 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386537, 468673, 70375, '<td valign="top">Dark and depressing. Music is bright and beautiful. I am not a fan of the tones used here or the composition. Though this fits the challenge perfectly, it does not convey the happiness or love of music to me. I would love to see the origial as I am willing to bet it is full of colour, bright, and gorgeous.</td>', 'Dark and depressing. Music is bright and beautiful. I am not a fan of the tones used here or the composition. Though this fits the challenge perfectly, it does not convey the happiness or love of music to me. I would love to see the origial as I am willing to bet it is full of colour, bright, and gorgeous.', '2007-02-20 18:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386549, 465965, 70375, '<td valign="top">Nice title, nice composition. Overall a pretty good photo!! I am not a fan of the heavy border here buuuut, I am a fan of the sheets of music AND THE FENDER!! HECK YEAH!! LOL Good luck!</td>', 'Nice title, nice composition. Overall a pretty good photo!! I am not a fan of the heavy border here buuuut, I am a fan of the sheets of music AND THE FENDER!! HECK YEAH!! LOL Good luck!', '2007-02-20 18:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386550, 466358, 70375, '<td valign="top">This kid is ready to rock the house!! :) I am wondering if he is looking at his reflection in that cymbal LOL  Good composition and colour. Plus, it made me smile :)</td>', 'This kid is ready to rock the house!! :) I am wondering if he is looking at his reflection in that cymbal LOL  Good composition and colour. Plus, it made me smile :)', '2007-02-20 18:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386558, 468206, 70375, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sillouhette! Background wrinkles are a wee bit distracting to my eye and make me want to look away from the main subject. My first thought was, what a great take on this challenge! So, you gain a point for that ;)</td>', 'Beautiful sillouhette! Background wrinkles are a wee bit distracting to my eye and make me want to look away from the main subject. My first thought was, what a great take on this challenge! So, you gain a point for that ;)', '2007-02-20 18:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386561, 468461, 70375, '<td valign="top">Well, your trebel clefs are getting better :) I remember that... ohhh lost days! Great DOF!!</td>', 'Well, your trebel clefs are getting better :) I remember that... ohhh lost days! Great DOF!!', '2007-02-20 18:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386568, 466816, 70375, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, beautiful B&amp;W!! Your border works here as this image really needed a frame :)</td>', 'Nice composition, beautiful B&W!! Your border works here as this image really needed a frame :)', '2007-02-20 18:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386663, 468553, 64446, '<td valign="top">Wow, I thought of a similar shot myself. Well done!<br/>I like the dof, sharp focus and the clean white on the music sheet. The color of the flute looks tinted with magenta, for me (which I don''t like). Maybe it is its actual color anyway...</td>', 'Wow, I thought of a similar shot myself. Well done!I like the dof, sharp focus and the clean white on the music sheet. The color of the flute looks tinted with magenta, for me (which I don''t like). Maybe it is its actual color anyway...', '2007-02-20 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386669, 467225, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W composition: I like it very much. I wish it was a bit sharper, though...</td>', 'Nice B&W composition: I like it very much. I wish it was a bit sharper, though...', '2007-02-20 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
