(3387290, 467688, 70375, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes on your model :) I like the bass... it is nice and shiny, looks new which probably means the owner took good care of it. I love B&amp;W so, dear photog, you got bonus points for that :) Focus is spot on and the border works well here as I feel that this image really needs something to "define" its boundaries. Nice high key shot! I feel a good score out of this one. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful eyes on your model :) I like the bass... it is nice and shiny, looks new which probably means the owner took good care of it. I love B&W so, dear photog, you got bonus points for that :) Focus is spot on and the border works well here as I feel that this image really needs something to "define" its boundaries. Nice high key shot! I feel a good score out of this one. Good luck!', '2007-02-20 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3387303, 465849, 70375, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at that hair! I appreciate that her head is held straight and her flute is not bent down toward the ground. Her poise is good too. I love that you went out to the concert to catch this :) B&amp;W is always a winner IMB and your border looks like a lovely frame here. I see a good score for you out of this one and I wish you luck :)</td>', 'Wow, look at that hair! I appreciate that her head is held straight and her flute is not bent down toward the ground. Her poise is good too. I love that you went out to the concert to catch this :) B&W is always a winner IMB and your border looks like a lovely frame here. I see a good score for you out of this one and I wish you luck :)', '2007-02-20 23:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
