(3388540, 465396, 70514, '<td valign="top">I obviously have a great weakness at conveying a message in a photograph.  But it is actually the peg that is broken.  At the age of 13, I did not have a trusted adult who would take me to get it fixed or pay to get it fixed.  I was just trying to figure out a way to do this, and I failed.  But I feel like I''ve learned a lot, again.  Hope this explains a little.</td>', 'I obviously have a great weakness at conveying a message in a photograph.  But it is actually the peg that is broken.  At the age of 13, I did not have a trusted adult who would take me to get it fixed or pay to get it fixed.  I was just trying to figure out a way to do this, and I failed.  But I feel like I''ve learned a lot, again.  Hope this explains a little.', '2007-02-21 08:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388545, 465468, 24613, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote all the photos in this challenge and I missed this one - it''s a shame.  As far as the other comments you received, the title of the challenge wasn''t "School Days Spelling"!, so don''t worry about that.  I love the crop!  Not seeing everything is a great touch.  Keep shooting - I''m looking forward to more great photos from you in future challenges.  Good luck. :)</td>', 'I didn''t vote all the photos in this challenge and I missed this one - it''s a shame.  As far as the other comments you received, the title of the challenge wasn''t "School Days Spelling"!, so don''t worry about that.  I love the crop!  Not seeing everything is a great touch.  Keep shooting - I''m looking forward to more great photos from you in future challenges.  Good luck. :)', '2007-02-21 08:34:13.000000', NULL, 0),
