(3388621, 468507, 55956, '<td valign="top">well, I haven''t rated this image during voting. I think that is a good image, the B/W is clean but a bit dark. there aren''t elements that permit me to understand that the image is captured in a school but this isn''t a true problem because I think that the theme must not be in a school. the only problem that I see in this image is the same problem that is in many many shots in this contest. There are only instruments perhaps because the music is difficult to photograph :)  P.S. yes this image isn''t free, nobody image is free but unfortunately every image on internet is in the facts free. 6.15 isn''t a bad result. often I don''t understand rating as 3 or 4 image that are good but sometimes there are images that win the contests with 1 and 2.  regards<br/>Gennaro</td>', 'well, I haven''t rated this image during voting. I think that is a good image, the B/W is clean but a bit dark. there aren''t elements that permit me to understand that the image is captured in a school but this isn''t a true problem because I think that the theme must not be in a school. the only problem that I see in this image is the same problem that is in many many shots in this contest. There are only instruments perhaps because the music is difficult to photograph :)  P.S. yes this image isn''t free, nobody image is free but unfortunately every image on internet is in the facts free. 6.15 isn''t a bad result. often I don''t understand rating as 3 or 4 image that are good but sometimes there are images that win the contests with 1 and 2.  regardsGennaro', '2007-02-21 08:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388624, 468449, 66384, '<td valign="top">Pretty daughter, I like her eyes in this shot. I would like the shot better if the clarinet was angled just a little to the right of the picture, showing more of the instrument and reducing the negative space. But that''s just my for my eye. You have a strong image here.</td>', 'Pretty daughter, I like her eyes in this shot. I would like the shot better if the clarinet was angled just a little to the right of the picture, showing more of the instrument and reducing the negative space. But that''s just my for my eye. You have a strong image here.', '2007-02-21 08:54:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388641, 468314, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, Kashi. It has excellent color, good composition, and light. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this shot, Kashi. It has excellent color, good composition, and light.  ', '2007-02-21 08:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388644, 468612, 29011, '<td valign="top">An excellent closeup! clear and crisp. Nicely composed, lit and everything in between :)<br/>I dont get that the 3 comments out of the 5 comments you received during the challenge mention "the no school" connection. I can pick at least 10 other shots that placed better and had no more connection and maybe even less and still didn''t get as many DNMC comments, pffft. So including music sheet paper automatically makes the shot on topic eh? hmmm. The challenge topic was sort of confusing without having any specific description, but still dont get the high percentage of DNMC comments here. Perhaps people just don''t relate that well to guitars and school days :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-21 09:00:16.</i></td>', 'An excellent closeup! clear and crisp. Nicely composed, lit and everything in between :)I dont get that the 3 comments out of the 5 comments you received during the challenge mention "the no school" connection. I can pick at least 10 other shots that placed better and had no more connection and maybe even less and still didn''t get as many DNMC comments, pffft. So including music sheet paper automatically makes the shot on topic eh? hmmm. The challenge topic was sort of confusing without having any specific description, but still dont get the high percentage of DNMC comments here. Perhaps people just don''t relate that well to guitars and school days :P', '2007-02-21 08:59:14.000000', '2007-02-21 09:00:16.000000', 0),
(3388654, 466542, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very creative photograph, congratulations on winning the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Very creative photograph, congratulations on winning the blue ribbon!', '2007-02-21 09:02:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388668, 466796, 29011, '<td valign="top">awww. Saddened this shot didn''t make it in. I was hoping this would do well. I agree with Tim, this is one of your best shots. So if you tried to shoot it specifically for this challenge, which you mostly likely did. It''s still a great outcome. You got a great keeper! :D</td>', 'awww. Saddened this shot didn''t make it in. I was hoping this would do well. I agree with Tim, this is one of your best shots. So if you tried to shoot it specifically for this challenge, which you mostly likely did. It''s still a great outcome. You got a great keeper! :D', '2007-02-21 09:08:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388676, 468205, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool with all the reflections, congratulations on winning the red ribbon!</td>', 'Very cool with all the reflections, congratulations on winning the red ribbon!', '2007-02-21 09:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388682, 468692, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice light and tones, congratulations on winning the yellow ribbon!</td>', 'Nice light and tones, congratulations on winning the yellow ribbon!', '2007-02-21 09:11:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388764, 468314, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m betting this will do really well as a stock shot - it''s clean, simple, sharp and colorful.  And to submit to stock you can edit out whatever you want!</td>', 'I''m betting this will do really well as a stock shot - it''s clean, simple, sharp and colorful.  And to submit to stock you can edit out whatever you want!', '2007-02-21 09:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388825, 466542, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. So glad the crowd went for the artful approach!!</td>', 'Beautiful. So glad the crowd went for the artful approach!!', '2007-02-21 09:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388912, 467465, 66038, '<td valign="top">I Think it is a great shot and the provocative appeal while hiding behind the instrument of it is what linked it to school days for me.<br/> Nice job.</td>', 'I Think it is a great shot and the provocative appeal while hiding behind the instrument of it is what linked it to school days for me. Nice job.', '2007-02-21 10:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388942, 468314, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, sharp, and very colorful.  And it''s a challenge about school, so I think kids'' toys fit just fine!<br/> <br/>One thing to watch for is sharp reflections of lights.  Try putting a piece of tissue paper over the light (I use a piece that came in a gift bag).  That''ll turn it into a fuzzy bright spot.</td>', 'Nicely lit, sharp, and very colorful.  And it''s a challenge about school, so I think kids'' toys fit just fine! One thing to watch for is sharp reflections of lights.  Try putting a piece of tissue paper over the light (I use a piece that came in a gift bag).  That''ll turn it into a fuzzy bright spot.', '2007-02-21 10:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388949, 467563, 60910, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  I gave this a 7, and really don''t know why I did not rate this higher, for that I am mad at myself.  This deserves a 10, and placement in the contest higher than it did.. Bravo to a wonderful piece of work.  It''s just an amazing capture!!  You should be proud..  Regards, Sheila</td>', 'This is wonderful.  I gave this a 7, and really don''t know why I did not rate this higher, for that I am mad at myself.  This deserves a 10, and placement in the contest higher than it did.. Bravo to a wonderful piece of work.  It''s just an amazing capture!!  You should be proud..  Regards, Sheila', '2007-02-21 10:17:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388956, 468560, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, well about the DQ.  Now you know.  But this is a great, funny shot.  My daughter (featured in my Music entry) is learning to play the clarinet, and 3 Blind Mice and Hot Cross buns figure prominently in her repertoire!</td>', 'Oh, well about the DQ.  Now you know.  But this is a great, funny shot.  My daughter (featured in my Music entry) is learning to play the clarinet, and 3 Blind Mice and Hot Cross buns figure prominently in her repertoire!', '2007-02-21 10:19:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389125, 468205, 28532, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!! Awesome image!! Congrats on the red ribbon!</td>', 'Sweet!!! Awesome image!! Congrats on the red ribbon!', '2007-02-21 11:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389128, 467563, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice finish overall coming in 26th.  Top 20 would have been more appropriate IMO.  :D<br/> <br/>I like how you''re a poet also - eh?  <br/> <br/>From photographer comments: "... Calm, steady hand harnessing a racing pencil; putting fleeting musical thoughts to paper. The flute is at hand and ready to test drive the fresh, newly written melodies. ..."</td>', 'Nice finish overall coming in 26th.  Top 20 would have been more appropriate IMO.  :D I like how you''re a poet also - eh?   From photographer comments: "... Calm, steady hand harnessing a racing pencil; putting fleeting musical thoughts to paper. The flute is at hand and ready to test drive the fresh, newly written melodies. ..."', '2007-02-21 11:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389130, 468692, 28532, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot - love it!!Congrats on the yellow ribbon!!</td>', 'Amazing shot - love it!!Congrats on the yellow ribbon!!', '2007-02-21 11:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389185, 468689, 30049, '<td valign="top">Amazing all of the comments about motion blur.  :D  I think the motion blur helps bring the photo to life, adds interest.  This was a tough shot to get and you captured it quite well IMO.  ISO 1600, wide open aperture...can''t get much faster than that (well, I guess you could have gone ISO 3200 - then hello noise!).<br/> <br/>This was one of my two 10''s for the challenge.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Amazing all of the comments about motion blur.  :D  I think the motion blur helps bring the photo to life, adds interest.  This was a tough shot to get and you captured it quite well IMO.  ISO 1600, wide open aperture...can''t get much faster than that (well, I guess you could have gone ISO 3200 - then hello noise!). This was one of my two 10''s for the challenge.  Nicely done!', '2007-02-21 11:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389202, 466542, 57886, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I am going to try this one day - t.i. the projector part of it :o) Congrats on your first blue :o)</td>', 'Great picture, I am going to try this one day - t.i. the projector part of it :o) Congrats on your first blue :o)', '2007-02-21 11:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389465, 466796, 69246, '<td valign="top">Too bad for the DQ. I gave this one a high rating!</td>', 'Too bad for the DQ. I gave this one a high rating!', '2007-02-21 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389518, 468548, 47852, '<td valign="top">I thought I recognized you!  Wish you''d put in the photographers notes how you did this one.  The dramatic sky is nice and it''s a creative concept.  You probably got a few low votes because people thought it wasn''t legal (though, you had it validated I thought when I saw it in voting).  I think the two things that I didn''t like most about this was the size perspective... your face seems out of proportion to the landscape (if that is possible), and that the music notes aren''t entirely black.  But I love the creativity here... (and you even got a favorite out of it!) Keep it up!  GO Team D50! :)</td>', 'I thought I recognized you!  Wish you''d put in the photographers notes how you did this one.  The dramatic sky is nice and it''s a creative concept.  You probably got a few low votes because people thought it wasn''t legal (though, you had it validated I thought when I saw it in voting).  I think the two things that I didn''t like most about this was the size perspective... your face seems out of proportion to the landscape (if that is possible), and that the music notes aren''t entirely black.  But I love the creativity here... (and you even got a favorite out of it!) Keep it up!  GO Team D50! :)', '2007-02-21 12:10:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389625, 468650, 47852, '<td valign="top">Well, those are some interesting comments :P  I thought this looked a bit ''snapshot-ish'' too, but I was happy that the photographer had at least thought to put the boy in front of a whole background instead of just wherever.  It does have a soft feel to it overall, and I think if he had been playing with his left hand on the guitar as well, it might have given a better impression?  Cute kid though... he looks like he''d be handy to have around as a model for other challenges if he''s such a ham!  Go team D50!</td>', 'Well, those are some interesting comments :P  I thought this looked a bit ''snapshot-ish'' too, but I was happy that the photographer had at least thought to put the boy in front of a whole background instead of just wherever.  It does have a soft feel to it overall, and I think if he had been playing with his left hand on the guitar as well, it might have given a better impression?  Cute kid though... he looks like he''d be handy to have around as a model for other challenges if he''s such a ham!  Go team D50!', '2007-02-21 12:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389659, 468042, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow, you ended up with a lot of comments here.  I like the minimalism in the shot, but it needed a bit better lighting to come off the way you probably wanted it to.  Someone pointed out the shadows under the mouthpiece for instance.  I''m not an expert with lighting, but trying to light something this wide, maybe reflecting some light upward onto a reflective surface that shined back down on the flute would have worked?  These basic editing challenges are much harder because you can''t make those fixes in individual spots with the post processing.   Go team D50!<br/> <br/>As an afterthought... I think this also feels backwards to me, since I would hold the flute with the mouthpiece at the left if I were playing it.  Might not make for the keys looking as neat though.  Hmm.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-21 12:28:26.</i></td>', 'Wow, you ended up with a lot of comments here.  I like the minimalism in the shot, but it needed a bit better lighting to come off the way you probably wanted it to.  Someone pointed out the shadows under the mouthpiece for instance.  I''m not an expert with lighting, but trying to light something this wide, maybe reflecting some light upward onto a reflective surface that shined back down on the flute would have worked?  These basic editing challenges are much harder because you can''t make those fixes in individual spots with the post processing.   Go team D50! As an afterthought... I think this also feels backwards to me, since I would hold the flute with the mouthpiece at the left if I were playing it.  Might not make for the keys looking as neat though.  Hmm.', '2007-02-21 12:26:41.000000', '2007-02-21 12:28:26.000000', 0),
(3389691, 465849, 29156, '<td valign="top">great lighting and very good in b&amp;w</td>', 'great lighting and very good in b&w', '2007-02-21 12:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389698, 466542, 29156, '<td valign="top">very original, good composition</td>', 'very original, good composition', '2007-02-21 12:32:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389701, 468205, 29156, '<td valign="top">great reflection</td>', 'great reflection', '2007-02-21 12:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389716, 468173, 13026, '<td valign="top">i knew this was you.  =)<br/>congrats on 6th, toe.</td>', 'i knew this was you.  =)congrats on 6th, toe.', '2007-02-21 12:35:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3389930, 465556, 56502, '<td valign="top">Surprised me that this didn''t do better. I like the composition and the minimalistic approach. I find the black bars a bit distracting, but otherwise: great!</td>', 'Surprised me that this didn''t do better. I like the composition and the minimalistic approach. I find the black bars a bit distracting, but otherwise: great!', '2007-02-21 13:22:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3390065, 468689, 47852, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top picks from the challenge... who knew it was taken almost in my backyard!  Loved the motion here... really brings the shot to life for me.  Great job! :)</td>', 'This was one of my top picks from the challenge... who knew it was taken almost in my backyard!  Loved the motion here... really brings the shot to life for me.  Great job! :)', '2007-02-21 13:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3390263, 466542, 64795, '<td valign="top">Great job! This was so creative.  My choice for the blue as well.</td>', 'Great job! This was so creative.  My choice for the blue as well.', '2007-02-21 14:31:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3390268, 468205, 64795, '<td valign="top">Great image!  This is so creative.  I love how the saxophone (? if it is one..) is tilted.</td>', 'Great image!  This is so creative.  I love how the saxophone (? if it is one..) is tilted.', '2007-02-21 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3390451, 466542, 50674, '<td valign="top">Fantastic first ribbon - congrats.<br/>Beautiful photograph, simple and elegant.</td>', 'Fantastic first ribbon - congrats.Beautiful photograph, simple and elegant.', '2007-02-21 15:32:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3390463, 467225, 64733, '<td valign="top">Again, a very nice shot.  Same as my comments from before.  I''d like to see some outtakes if you have them, showing the stage setup and maybe some alternate angles.</td>', 'Again, a very nice shot.  Same as my comments from before.  I''d like to see some outtakes if you have them, showing the stage setup and maybe some alternate angles.', '2007-02-21 15:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
