(3410022, 466316, 51802, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from the Critique Club!</b> <br/> <br/>First off, let me say welcome to DPC!  I see that this is your first challenge entry.<br/> <br/>There are a few things to keep in mind when entering challenges on this site.  First of those would be to ensure you use the full image dimensions available to you.  This image is only 400 pixels wide, for this challenge you are allowed 640 pixels for your widest dimension.  Unfortunately, a lot of people will deduct points from your score just due to the size of your image regardless of how good it is.<br/> <br/>Another thing to keep in mind is the challenge description.  In my opinion, this photo does not meet the challenge, and I believe your score reflects this.<br/> <br/>As to you photo, this image does not do much to capture the viewer''s attention or imagination.  This is very important if you want your entry to stand out from everyone else''s in the challenge.<br/> <br/>I hope you are not discouraged by all of this.  This is a great site to learn about photography and there are a lot of really good and helpful photographers out there.</td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club!  First off, let me say welcome to DPC!  I see that this is your first challenge entry. There are a few things to keep in mind when entering challenges on this site.  First of those would be to ensure you use the full image dimensions available to you.  This image is only 400 pixels wide, for this challenge you are allowed 640 pixels for your widest dimension.  Unfortunately, a lot of people will deduct points from your score just due to the size of your image regardless of how good it is. Another thing to keep in mind is the challenge description.  In my opinion, this photo does not meet the challenge, and I believe your score reflects this. As to you photo, this image does not do much to capture the viewer''s attention or imagination.  This is very important if you want your entry to stand out from everyone else''s in the challenge. I hope you are not discouraged by all of this.  This is a great site to learn about photography and there are a lot of really good and helpful photographers out there.', '2007-02-27 14:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
