(3995995, 468599, 69008, '<td valign="top">Nice axe, and great perspective with the super wide. I did a similar shot outside in the grass with a round hole acoustic 12 string, and put the reflection of a palm tree centered in the head of the guitar, between the posts of the tuning keys. <br/>I like the barroom connection in this shot with the music and pool. It seems like there should be a cigarette in there somewhere, or at least some smoke, but I don''t guess it is that prominent now days. 30 years ago when my band played barrooms, you wouldn''t even be able to see the far end of the guitar neck for all the smoke LOL .</td>', 'Nice axe, and great perspective with the super wide. I did a similar shot outside in the grass with a round hole acoustic 12 string, and put the reflection of a palm tree centered in the head of the guitar, between the posts of the tuning keys. I like the barroom connection in this shot with the music and pool. It seems like there should be a cigarette in there somewhere, or at least some smoke, but I don''t guess it is that prominent now days. 30 years ago when my band played barrooms, you wouldn''t even be able to see the far end of the guitar neck for all the smoke LOL .', '2007-08-14 02:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
